All of these are for 3.0j. In 3.1 there are more such as Magicbane.
Also, in 3.1 Stormbringer is a runned sword.

Special : -

Cold - The extra damage done is cold. As a result cold resistant 
        creatures are NOT affected.
Defend - This defend you against whatever special attack type the 
        artifact has. Excalibur and Stormbringer will defend you against 
        drain level attacks, Frost Brand will defend you against cold 
        based attacks. (Even though Excalibur can't drain levels itself 
        it will protect you aginst those types of attacks).
Drain Level - This will drain a level from the creature hit, effectivly 
        effectivly making it less powerul. Also, as a result it will lose 
        8 hp from it's max hp. (hp = hit points, for all ye newbies!).
Fire - The extra damage done is fire based. As a result fire resistant 
        creatures will NOT be affected.
Search - This will aid you in searching. (I.E.-secret doors) Much as a 
        ring of searching does.
Seek - This should aid you in searching objects. (Curently in 3.0j this 
        option is not implimented. I do not know if it is in 3.1 yet.)
Shock - The extra damage done is electrical damage. As a result shock 
        resistant creatures will NOT be affected.
Warn - Will warn you when more powerful creatures are near. Much as a 
        ring of warning.

